Package: kaidf
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv
Maintainer: K-AIDF maintainers <https://github.com/kobkob/K-AIDF>
Homepage: https://github.com/kobkob/K-AIDF
Description: K-AIDF terminal agent (kob) and generator
 kob is the terminal agent for K-AIDF repositories. The package bundles the
 kaidf_gen generator and starts from /usr/bin/kob. Its Python libraries are
 installed into a private virtualenv at /usr/lib/kaidf/venv, because the
 distributions' own packages are older than the agent needs. Project state
 (.kaidf/) and user settings (~/.config/kaidf) are not package files, so
 upgrades and removal keep them.
